{"name":"Overcast","hex":"#73a3d0","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"overcast","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A cloud covering all of the sky from horizon to horizon.","An outcast."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Covered with clouds; overshadowed; darkened;  more than 90% covered by clouds.","In a state of depression; gloomy; melancholy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/overcast"}],"entries":[{"title":"Overcast","blocks":[{"text":"Overcast or overcast weather, as defined by the World Meteorological Organization, is the meteorological condition of clouds obscuring at least 95% of the sky. However, the total cloud cover must not be entirely due to obscuring phenomena near the surface, such as fog."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a9/Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg/330px-Cloudy_weather_in_Yekaterinburg.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overcast","wikidata":"Q1055865"},{"title":"Overcast (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Overcast was an American metalcore band that formed in Boston and was initially active from 1990 to 1998. The band is often regarded as pioneers of metalcore."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/2014-08-30_Turock_Shadows_Fall_06.jpg/330px-2014-08-30_Turock_Shadows_Fall_06.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Overcast_(band)","wikidata":"Q2903232"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Overcast_Mehamn.jpg/500px-Overcast_Mehamn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Overcast_Mehamn.jpg/1280px-Overcast_Mehamn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2f/Over